  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Its not that important, but vrchats keyboard layout for typing in world menus or usernames always bugged me. The shift button is weird, some function buttons are in the \"wrong place\". Everything works, but its just not in the universal keyboard layout. Just a minor nuisance, the world wont end if its not fixed, just didnt know if anyone else feels the same so im throwing it out there.",
